lved in the transcriptional corepression of NF-kappaB in macrophages (PubMed:18025162). Plays a role as a regulator in the pro-inflammatory cascade (PubMed:18025162)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}